        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "> Do you think going back to creating default links to built-in groups is not worth it (against your vision)?\r\n\r\nNo, I think its definitely worth it. There's some \"fancy\" stuff I'm trying to make work, like context-aware cursorline highlights, changing the highlight of the hunk/section the cursor is in, stuff like that, which means I need the extra groups, but... I think I just didn't know how to set them up properly 🤷🏼 \r\n\r\nHopefully https://github.com/NeogitOrg/neogit/pull/617 fixes things for everyone :)",
            "created_at": "2023-07-17T20:44:42Z",
